  "solution": "$$\\frac{R}{H} = \\frac{2u^2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta/g}{u^2\\sin^2\\theta/2g} = 4\\cot\\theta$$\n$$4\\cot\\theta = 4\\sqrt{3} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\cot\\theta = \\sqrt{3} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\theta = 30°$$",
